  "description": "<!-- Generated by scripts/extract_part1_v1.py; source SHA-256 1a1dcb80556dc054440fab25ef73c1535549c19e9e327877cf1c17f65007d32d. -->\n\n<p class=\"source-citation\"><a href=\"https://docs.ogc.org/is/18-062r2/18-062r2.html#toc1\">Published source: OGC 18-062r2, 1.0.0 (toc1)</a>.</p>\n\n<div class=\"Section3\" id=\"_d1a66fbb-8700-4108-b30d-67b7f6e70e5a\">\n<span id=\"toc1\"></span>\n<p>The following are keywords to be used by search engines and\n    document catalogues.</p>\n<p>ogcdoc, OGC document, OGC API, Geospatial API, processes, Web Processing Service, WPS, JSON, HTML, geoprocessing, API, OpenAPI, HTML</p>\n</div>\n",
